  "changelog": "- Initial release of geoskill-lidar-canopy-structure (version 1.0.0).\n- Extracts forest canopy structure parameters from LiDAR point clouds: generates DTM, computes CHM, detects individual trees, and extracts tree height and crown parameters.\n- Supports both real point cloud data and synthetic (simulated) data modes.\n- Outputs include canopy height model (GeoTIFF), detected tree attributes (GeoJSON), statistics (JSON), and run manifest (JSON).\n- Fully offline operation; local processing ensures data privacy.\n- Detailed usage instructions and dependencies provided.",
